    <statement><p>To obtain a new graph, stretch the graph of a function <m>f(x)</m> 
vertically by a factor of 7.  Then shift the new graph 4 units to the 
right and 9 units up.  The result is the graph of a function 
<me>g(x) = A f(x+B) +C</me> 
where <m>A</m>, <m>B</m>, <m>C</m> are certain numbers.  What are <m>A</m>, 
<m>B</m>, and <m>C</m>?</p>
<p><m>A =</m> <fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0001"/>,  <m>B =</m> <fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0002"/>,  
<m>C =</m> <fillin characters="8" name="AnSwEr0003"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>7</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>-4</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>9</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
